{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1219881-titan-s-throwing-a-person","id":1219881,"title":"Titan's throwing a person","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-17T22:05:34-07:00","id":1219881,"title":"Titan's throwing a person","content":"So my Promethean has the alembic(azoth to strength) with the distillation where you can multiply your strength by up to 4 times for throwing stuff. Also, the one where you add 3 to strength and 1 to dex. AND the one where you can roll strength + athletics+ azoth(currently 2, close to making it 3) and add successes to athletic endeavors.<br /> <br /> The question is, once all this stuff is done, for the purpose of throwing stuff, I can get a strength in the 30's easily. If I throw a person...how much damage is a throw of 20-100 yards doing to an enemy? Like...if i grapple a human, i accept that the last distillation doesn't count, because i'm in combat. But my strength is still gonna be 8, then at least tripled, if not quadrupled, and their size may be reduced by 1 or 2. So that means I throw a standard person 32(strength) +3(dex) +3(athletics)-3(size minus 2 from distillation successes) for short range=35 yards, medium=70, and long 140...and twice long for 280 yards...seriously...Am I killing stuff, or just gently tossing them a few city blocks?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T07:37:15-07:00","id":1219962,"title":"","content":"There's falling damage in the book, I think, but yeah, you throw a normal person that far, in all probability they're dead.<br /> <br /> Did your character learn something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T09:21:27-07:00","id":1219985,"title":"","content":"He will, once we rule that throwing a person does that damage. So far, he has only done it to an antagonist Promethean who was very tough and therefore was just lobbed &quot;off screen.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T14:56:50-07:00","id":1220098,"title":"","content":"Off the direct topic, but if they <i>were </i>a character that had powers, I'd give them a turn during &quot;air time&quot; at which to use some reinforcing or teleportation powers to prevent being splatted.<br /> <br /> As normal humans lack such powers/options, they can spend the turn regretting their life choices that brought them to this point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 05-18-2018, 06:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T19:14:02-07:00","id":1220154,"title":"","content":"Solid idea Vent0. I'll toss that idea to the other GMs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T20:19:06-07:00","id":1220167,"title":"","content":"Heh heh, toss that idea.<br /> <br /> *easily amused*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T02:02:52-07:00","id":1220205,"title":"","content":"I believe the rules use size for damage, so it works like a normal thrown object if you damage someone *else* with them. Successes+Size.<br /> <br /> As for the damage they take, just use the falling rules based on the distance they would be thrown, even if they stop short, say via a concrete wall or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8122-archonares","name":"ArchonAres","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T13:13:38-07:00","id":1220313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArchonAres</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1219881-titan-s-throwing-a-person?p=1220205#post1220205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe the rules use size for damage, so it works like a normal thrown object if you damage someone *else* with them. Successes+Size.<br /> <br /> As for the damage they take, just use the falling rules based on the distance they would be thrown, even if they stop short, say via a concrete wall or something.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So you're saying that if a titan uses a person as a baseball/Javelin/keg toss, if they collide with another person, that person would take the throw damage(falling damage distance) plus size(5 for most people) right? And if you threw someone say, 50 yards, but they stop at 5, they would take the 10 lethal as that passes terminal velocity? Or would you count less falling damage but also include damage for collision(say a wall or car)?<br /> <br /> I'm the first person in our group to play a Promethean, and we are starting with 2nd edition rules...so we aren't sure if this is even supposed to be in the capabilities, or if we just found an extremely violent, deadly loophole.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T13:30:40-07:00","id":1220318,"title":"","content":"Well, that equivalent Strength making a punch will probably turn someone into paste anyways, so the lethality is likely fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T14:08:19-07:00","id":1220326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ManBearPig</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1219881-titan-s-throwing-a-person?p=1220313#post1220313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> So you're saying that if a titan uses a person as a baseball/Javelin/keg toss, if they collide with another person, that person would take the throw damage(falling damage distance) plus size(5 for most people) right? And if you threw someone say, 50 yards, but they stop at 5, they would take the 10 lethal as that passes terminal velocity? Or would you count less falling damage but also include damage for collision(say a wall or car)?<br /> <br /> I'm the first person in our group to play a Promethean, and we are starting with 2nd edition rules...so we aren't sure if this is even supposed to be in the capabilities, or if we just found an extremely violent, deadly loophole.</div> </div> </div> </div>Normal thrown is success+size or durability, I believe, whichever is lower. I'd utilize that for damage to other persons. I'd use falling damage with the modifications above to simulate the damage they take themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8122-archonares","name":"ArchonAres","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}